Thus we need to keep those resources untouched (or restore them). Simpler: don't use them.

Goal also requires origin_availability_alpha dispatched; but to dispatch origin_availability_alpha we need to have it dispatch_allocated, vehicle linked, dispatch slot linked, and not dispatched yet.

