Thus to dispatch origin_availability_alpha we need to also lock destination_availability_alpha (maybe we don't need to dispatch it, but need it for transport leg). However goal also requires dispatched origin_availability_alpha only; but we can still use destination_availability_alpha as part of process, as long as we don't dispatch it (goal doesn't require it dispatched). That's okay.

